NAME
    gcloud compute rollouts - read and manipulate Compute Engine Rollouts

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud compute rollouts COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Read and manipulate Compute Engine Rollouts.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     cancel
        Cancel a Google Compute Engine rollout.

     delete
        Delete a Google Compute Engine rollout.

     describe
        Describe a rollout.

     list
        List Google Compute Engine Rollouts.

NOTES
    These variants are also available:

        $ gcloud alpha compute rollouts

        $ gcloud beta compute rollouts

